QuestGuidance.Register("en",426,{
[13601]="70066072\n1\tAffix the delving garnet to the delving stone (quantity: see journal)\030Acquire a delving garnet (quantity: see journal)\tYou must place a delving garnet into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tFind and open the final chest within the space\tA malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies to rid the evil from the world. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tSpeak with a mission giver who knows about delvings\tHaving completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to a mission giver who knows about delvings, and tell them of your success.\n",
[13602]="7006291A\n1\tAffix the delving emerald to the delving stone (quantity: see journal)\030Acquire a delving emerald (quantity: see journal)\tYou must place a delving emerald into the fissure in the delving stone. This will unlock the potency trapped within the gemstone and unleash it upon the world. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tComplete the current mission and find the scout\tA malice spread from within the gemstone you affixed to the delving stone. You must defeat the enemies and complete the mission to rid the evil from the world. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tSpeak with the mission giver\tHaving completed the mission with the malice affecting the denizens within, you should now make your way back to the mission giver and tell them of your success.\n",
