[13626]="700529EB\n1\tCollect fallen timber (total: 10)\tSkalla has asked you to gather fallen timber to repair the buildings in Vegbár. You should collect fallen timber from the area surrounding Vegbár.\n2\tTalk to Skalla\tSkalla can be found in Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in the Wolf-denes. You should talk to Skalla.\n",
[13627]="7004A8E6\n1\tFind Lúksu in the Tower of Cirith Ungol\tLúksu can be found in the Tower of Cirith Ungol. Captain Róglarg has offered you a break, and now expects you to eat an Orkish meal. You should find Lúksu and do your best to pretend that you have eaten his food.\n2\tPretend to eat Blúgzor\030Pretend to eat Zau\030Pretend to eat Thrulbuz\tCrates of Blúgzor, Zau, and Thrulbuz can be found near Lúksu in the Tower of Cirith Ungol. You have found Lúksu and must now \"sample\" his cooking.\n3\tTalk to Lúksu\tLúksu can be found in the Tower of Cirith Ungol. You have done your best to pretend that you ate and enjoyed Lúksu's food. You should now speak to Lúksu.\n",
[13628]="7006749A\n1\tAssist Nûrat at the eastern-most courtyard of outer Jax Phanâl\030Assist Tagar at the central outer courtyard of Jax Phanâl\030Assist Keteph at the main courtyard of Jax Phanâl\030Assist Girgish at the crest of Jax Phanâl\030Assist Stúkha at the crest of Jax Phanâl\tWhether he is sincere or not is debatable, but the magistrate of Jax Phanâl asked that you assist him in seeing to the needs of the populace of the outpost. There are five individuals needing assistance throughout Jax Phanâl.\n2\tSpeak with Magistrate Zebulo at the crest of Jax Phanâl\tYou completed the tasks set before you by the citizens of Jax Phanâl. Return to Magistrate Zebulo at the crest atop the stairs in eastern Jax Phanâl to inform him of your success.\n",
[13629]="7000EAB2\n1\tTalk to the Lossoth craftsmen\tThe Lossoth craftsmen are in the Great Lodge in Sûri-kylä, west of Nef. Nef has asked you to speak with the Lossoth craftsmen to learn if they are able to repair his broken shield.\n2\tTalk to Nef\tNef is in Sûri-kylä, east from the Great Lodge. You should return to Nef and tell him what you learned from Rauno.\n3\tTalk to Rauno\tRauno is in Sûri-kylä, west from Nef in the Great Lodge of Sûri-kylä. Nef has asked you to return to Rauno and try to convince him to craft a new shield for him.\n4\tCollect hard bones (total: 10)\030Collect worm scales (total: 10)\tHard bone can be found on beasts throughout Jä-rannit. Worm scale can be found on worms throughout Jä-rannit. Rauno has asked you to collect hard bones and worm scales so that he may make a shield for Nef.\n5\tTalk to Rauno\030Collect Hard Bone (total: 10)\030Collect Worm-scale (total: 10)\tRauno is in Sûri-kylä, north from where you collected the items he requested. You should bring the hard bones and worm scales to Rauno so he can complete Nef's shield.\n6\tGet the shield from Rauno\tRauno is in Sûri-kylä. You should speak with Rauno to see if Nef's shield is ready.\n7\tTalk to Nef\030Collect Shield\tNef is in Sûri-kylä, east from Rauno. Rauno told you to take the shield he made to Nef and bid him leave Sûri-kylä.\n",
[13630]="7000A8BB\n1\tCollect supplies from hidden stores (total: 6)\tStores of supplies are hidden in out-of-the-way locations throughout Annúminas. Dannassel has asked you to search for supply stores hidden throughout the city and to bring their contents to her. She warned you that Angmarim patrols may have already discovered and looted some of the stores.\n2\tBring recovered supplies to Dannassel\tDannassel is at Echad Garthadir, the Ranger-encampment in the heart of Annúminas. You have recovered some of the supplies from the stores hidden throughout Annúminas and should bring them to Dannassel.\n",
[13631]="700355EC\n1\tHead north behind the mountain to find a place to rest\tA good resting spot might be north behind the mountain cave, away from Byre Tor. You should head north to the other side of the mountain and find a spot to rest.\n2\tStand and think at the cliff's edge\tA good spot to stand and look beckons to you in the northern High Knolls. You should stand at the cliff's edge and look, and think on all the people who have been lost.\n3\tReflections upon those who died come unbidden to your mind....\tMemories of the dead come unbidden to your mind....\n4\tFind the women whose voices you heard\tThe voices you heard came from below your thinking spot in the northern High Knolls. You should climb down and see if you can find the women you heard.\n5\tReturn to Ránmald\tRánmald can be found in the cave north of Byre Tor. You should return to Ránmald.\n",
[13632]="700460B8\n1\tStay by the sides of the dying (total: 6)\tThe wounded and dying can be found in the High Hall, House of Remedies, and House of Rest, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. Find those wounded who do not have long in this world and stay with them while they are here.\n2\tReturn to Aragorn\tReturn to Aragorn in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing and tell him you have stayed with a number of dying men through their final moments.\n",
})
